This project builds on, but does not redistribute, the following:

- CosyVoice (https://github.com/FunAudioLLM/CosyVoice), Apache-2.0. npu_cosyvoice/flow.py
  reimplements the forward pass of CosyVoice3's DiT estimator; the model weights are downloaded
  separately under their own terms.
- whisper-xdna (https://github.com/drakosha/whisper-xdna), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Mikhail
  Kostryukov. docker/Dockerfile builds on its image (XRT, MLIR-AIE/IRON); scripts/compile_xclbin.py
  follows its rawxrt.compile_shape. The whisper target of docker/Dockerfile adds
  voice/whisper_entry.py to its published image, otherwise unmodified.
- MLIR-AIE (https://github.com/Xilinx/mlir-aie), Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception. The overlay is
  generated by its whole_array matrix-multiplication design.
- llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT. `make llm` fetches it at a pinned
  commit; csrc/cv_llm.c links against it, and npu_cosyvoice/llm.py uses its GGUF converter.
- XRT (https://github.com/Xilinx/XRT), Apache-2.0. Headers from Debian's libxrt-dev are used at
  build time.
